TotalDrop is a command-line file and text transfer utility with end-to-end
encryption and zero account requirements on OpenBSD arm64 (Apple Silicon
Asahi/OpenBSD laptops, ARM64 servers, and workstations).

Peers exchange a short human-readable transfer code over CPace PAKE, establish
an authenticated QUIC connection with Noise XXpsk3 + post-quantum ML-KEM-768,
display four shared verification words, and verify every transferred file with
BLAKE3 before placing it in the target folder.
